  ('web-development-1', 'web-development', 1, 'HTML Fundamentals', 'Discover how the structure of a web page is built with HTML elements.', 25, array['Discover how the structure of a web page is built with HTML elements. In this lesson you will work through the core ideas of "HTML Fundamentals" step by step, with short examples you can follow along with directly in your own project.', 'We start with the fundamental concepts and quickly move into practical application. Each concept includes a visual walkthrough and a hands-on exercise so you can see how it fits inside the wider Web Development syllabus.', 'By the end of this lesson you should feel comfortable applying "HTML Fundamentals" on your own. Take a moment to complete the practice task before moving on to the next lesson.']::text[]),
